 "remarks": "Summer escape opportunity to the incredibly charming Rowayton. This seaside village is in its glory during the summer months. Beautifully designed living spaces include on the 1st floor a large living room w/fireplace, a bright white eat-in kitchen that&apos;s open to a spacious family room, a formal dining room, a tucked away office if work beckons, and a mudroom. Right off the kitchen is access to an oversized deck w/grill for your summer BBQs and outdoor dining. The yard is park-like and perfect for a game of catch. Upstairs the sophisticated primary suite w/a King bed is flooded with light and is graced with a soaring ceiling, as well as a Zen-like ensuite bath and a walk-in closet. There are three other bedrooms, two with Queen size beds and one w/twin  beds with a hall bath. In the lower level, a second family room offers extra space for friends and family. Rowayton is known for its dynamic downtown, awesome restaurants, including Rowayton Seafood and Sails, pristine beaches and darling shops. A Summer to remember is waiting!",
